ing"}]},{"id":"CH_R2TV_KA_2:FGS6","text":"Variierende Umwelt und Konstitution plus unvollständige Techniken → individuelle Auswahl → Diversifikation ohne Erfolgsgarantie.","refs":["CH_R2TV_KA_2:A13","CH_R2TV_KA_2:A14","CH_R2TV_KA_2:A15","CH_R2TV_KA_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_R2TV_KA_2:FGS7","text":"Religiöse Uniformierung → infantile Fixierung und Massenwahn → begrenzte neurotische Entlastung → Scheitern des Versprechens → Unterwerfung.","refs":["CH_R2TV_KA_2:A17","CH_R2TV_KA_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0097","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_R2TV_KA_2:AF1","text":"Religiöse Lebenszweckantwort → Zurückweisung der Teleologie → Rekonstruktion des Verhaltensziels → Lustprinzip → strukturelle Unerfüllbarkeit → Vorrang der Leidabwehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_R2TV_KA_2:P00